{"id":"motivo","lemma":"motivo","pos":"noun","rank":935,"glosses":["reason, ground, motive"],"ipa":"/moˈtibo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"motivos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/19/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-motivo.wav","examples":[{"text":"El motivo es claro.","en":"The reason is clear.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450270"},{"text":"Ella está ausente por motivos de salud.","en":"She's absent because she's sick.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594229"},{"text":"Quiero saber el motivo.","en":"I want to know the reason.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/734343"},{"text":"Ella dejó la escuela por motivos de salud.","en":"She quit school for health reasons.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687450"},{"text":"Me insultó sin motivo.","en":"He insulted me without reason.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/933826"}]}